<%= render partial: "hero" %>

<div class="concave-up bg-secondary"></div>
<div class="grid-max-2 grid-centred bg-secondary text-white p-2 p-sm-5">
  <h2>Who We Work With</h2>
  <div>
    <p>
      We work with entities that embrace situated, participatory, collaborative
      and empowerment approaches to community or social development.
      Our clients include the non-profit/social-purpose sector, civil society organizations,
      public-private partnerships, the public sector, and academic and non-profit partnerships.
      To date, we have contributed our services to initiatives in diverse regions of the Americas, Africa, and Asia.
    </p>
    <p>
      Are you passionate about designing and delivering impactful initiatives
      to address complex systems that generate social problems such as poverty,
      violence, racism, and forced migration?
      Are you a community-based organization, a public sector institution,
      an institution of academic teaching and learning, or a non-profit or non-governmental society?
      Let’s chat to see how the Verapax approach can work for you. We would love to connect with you!
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="concave-down bg-secondary"></div>

